      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IMPERIAL AUDREY (1) jumped cleanly from the low draw gave a big sight to finish second and beaten half a length (30.02) at this track in a Mix 5 over 520m. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from four starts. Deserves serious consideration. BANDIT CHLOE (2) was out of placings last time (20.24) at Capalaba in a Mix 5, finishing fifth and beaten 5 lengths. Has seven wins already from this draw. Looks suited here and can measure up. SWEET LADETTE (8) filled a minor placing last start at Q Lakeside behind Tusken Wind (21.91) in a Grade 4/5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Leading chance. MEMORIES OF ROSE (7) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
